; Regression for PR.md S4: freeing a long chain of nested closures used to
; recurse through the generated environment destructors and overflow the
; native stack (about 150k levels).  Release is iterative now, and the test
; requires live=0 so the whole chain really is reclaimed.
build → (λn f.
  if (== n 0)
  then f
  else (build (- n 1) (λx. (f x))))
g → (build 200000 (λx. x))
0
